Description: 512 bytes intro for Linux, released in 2008
 "An around 500B viagra pill for our vpenises" is a 508 bytes intro by TVT,
 released at Stream 2008 (4th in the PC 4k compo).
 .
 The intro is a self-extracting shell script: the gzipped C source is
 compiled with gcc each time it is started, then run with SDL 1.2 and
 OpenGL; the sound is played with aplay.
